InventoryAsset.description:
The canonical asset a Position holds. A fiat currency carries no network;
its marker comes from the producer (fiat), never from a symbol.

New values may be added; treat unknown values as other.

oneOf.description:
The protocol product this leg runs (`cctp`, `acrossBridge`, …), from the served route;
absent on a venue-account leg or when the route does not name it. Never parsed out of
`venue.name`, which is display text.

firmOnly.description:
`true` keeps only firm cards (`firm: true`): the venue is bound to the price until
`expiresAt`. Indicative cards and executable estimates held to `minOut` are left out;
absent or `false` keeps all.

