QuotesRequestBody.description:
The `POST /quotes` request. The required `kind` selects `pair` or `requote`;
missing or unknown tags are refused with `QUOTE_REQUEST_KIND_REQUIRED` or
`QUOTE_REQUEST_KIND_INVALID` before validating the selected payload.
